canon = "Ch22 (Keeper, [C]): she wears a gown to dinner. 'You're so far away', and the table shrinks (it costs him). She leads him to her locked painting room. Seeing the snowy one: 'That was your forest. Where you hunted', then 'That one. I want that one.' He keeps the snowy forest, not the glen. [X]: he keeps whichever of the player's canvases is most wintry, with her premade 'hazy landscape of snow and skeletal trees' as the guaranteed fallback; it hangs in his bedchamber (no study in canon)."
